    "detailed_description": "&quot;Embark on a thrilling journey with our new game where every second counts. You control a swift runner, bound by the confines of a rotating ring. With a simple click or a press of the space bar, you can switch between the inner and outer edges of the ring, dodging obstacles that threaten your path.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut beware! The game isn\u2019t as simple as it seems. As time ticks away, you\u2019ll encounter a variety of challenging gimmicks and your speed will progressively increase, pushing your reflexes to the limit.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo add to the thrill, the camera spins continuously, creating a dizzying effect that adds another layer of complexity to your journey. Can you keep up with the pace, or will you let the spinning world get the best of you?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience the rush, feel the adrenaline, and keep the runner going in this exhilarating, score-based game. Your agility and quick decision-making skills are the keys to achieving the highest score!&quot;",
